# Keep Pi dotfiles portable. Runtime state, credentials, generated models,
# logs, caches, sessions, and installed packages stay local.
*
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!keybindings.json
!mcp-adapter.json
!provider-failover.json
!settings.json
!extensions/
!extensions/**
!opt-extensions/
!opt-extensions/**
!prompts/
!prompts/**
!themes/
!themes/**
